    "concept_tag": "Multiple Definition",
    "front": "What is a multiple of a number?",
    "back": "The product of that number and any non-zero whole number.",
    "explanation_or_tip": "e.g., Multiples of 5 are 5, 10, 15, 20..."
  },
  {
    "id": "FC_CH13_002",
